{%- comment -%}
  Figma: Sections / Origin story (Templates FEEDBACK About us "Origin story" 2701:25884, mobile 2701:25894)
  Own section (one section per layout) on the breakout grid (.section-breakout, tailwind/tokens.css).
  Desktop: columns 1 to 6 hold two 217x260 photos at the top and, at the bottom over a rule, the caps label (217px)
  beside the heading and the story (body/sm at 60%). The portrait bleeds right from column 8, 795px tall.
  Mobile: label, heading and story first, then the two photos side by side. The portrait is not shown (as in Figma).
  Every photo can be a video instead (Hendrik, 23 Nov): a video plays muted and looped and wins over its photo.
  The heading and story are at most 560px wide; an empty line between story paragraphs (one line height). Text is
  balanced (text-balance on the section, inherited).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign media_1 = section.settings.video_1 | default: section.settings.image_1
  assign media_2 = section.settings.video_2 | default: section.settings.image_2
  assign portrait = section.settings.portrait_video | default: section.settings.portrait
-%}
<section class="origin-story section-shell bg-background text-balance text-text" data-padding-top="md" data-padding-bottom="lg">
  <div class="section-breakout">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 lg:justify-between lg:gap-10" style="--start-mobile: 1; --span-mobile: 4; --start: 1; --span: 6;">
      <div class="flex gap-gutter max-lg:order-2">
        {% render 'media', media: media_1, ratio: 'fill', autoplay: true, sizes: '(min-width: 1024px) 217px, 50vw', class: 'aspect-[173/207] min-w-0 flex-1 lg:aspect-auto lg:h-65 lg:w-54.25 lg:flex-none' %}
        {% render 'media', media: media_2, ratio: 'fill', autoplay: true, sizes: '(min-width: 1024px) 217px, 50vw', class: 'aspect-[173/207] min-w-0 flex-1 lg:aspect-auto lg:h-65 lg:w-54.25 lg:flex-none' %}
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 pt-5 lg:flex-row lg:gap-gutter lg:border-t lg:border-border lg:pt-4">
        {%- if section.settings.label != blank -%}
          <p class="text-label-caps lg:w-54.25 lg:shrink-0">{{ section.settings.label }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-6 lg:max-w-140 lg:gap-10">
          {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
            <h2 class="text-heading-3 lg:text-heading-1">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.text != blank -%}
            <div class="rte text-body-sm opacity-60 [&_p+p]:mt-[1lh]">{{ section.settings.text }}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-lg:hidden" data-bleed="right" style="--start: 8;">
      <div class="relative h-198.75 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-media bg-surface-alt">
        {% render 'media', media: portrait, ratio: 'fill', autoplay: true, sizes: '50vw', class: 'absolute! inset-0 size-full' %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Origin story",
  "tag": "div",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_1", "label": "Photo 1" },
    { "type": "video", "id": "video_1", "label": "Video 1", "info": "Optional. Plays muted and looped instead of the photo; the photo is not needed then." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_2", "label": "Photo 2" },
    { "type": "video", "id": "video_2", "label": "Video 2", "info": "Optional. Plays muted and looped instead of the photo; the photo is not needed then." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "portrait", "label": "Portrait", "info": "Desktop only, runs to the right edge" },
    { "type": "video", "id": "portrait_video", "label": "Portrait video", "info": "Optional. Plays muted and looped instead of the photo; the photo is not needed then." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label", "default": "MANJULA’s origin story" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "It started with eczema, and a recipe from my grandmother" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "text", "label": "Story", "default": "<p>I've had eczema since I was a baby: steroid creams, ingredient lists that made things worse, and a constant awareness of my skin. The answer had been in my family all along. My mother, Mamta, is an Ayurvedic practitioner, and her mother, Manjula, made her own hair oil at home.</p><p>Together with Canadian cosmetic chemists, my mother and I turned that recipe into three oils for hair, body and face, made for skin like mine. The brand carries my grandmother's name: it's a love letter to my maternal lineage.</p>" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Origin story" }]
}
{% endschema %}
